<description>&lt;p&gt;María Corina Machado has returned from exile, intensifying protests demanding elections and her continued presence in Venezuela. The United States has escalated military involvement, deploying Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems and destroying an alleged drug boat in the Pacific, killing five people. A bomb blast near the Colombia-Venezuela border injured at least four police officers, and a separate explosive attack on the same border injured six, including four officers. The death of federal judge Alvin Hellerstein, who oversaw the Maduro drug-trafficking case, leaves the trial without a presiding judge. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPV1d0SWlMTFdSdU5HcDh5RV9OaHB6bGxIT08zN29RWU1La1J1X3ZHRU9FdlRoeVBEeFVsOVRLVHpOLVZ1RmJsRmhPOGFabER5Tk5pWFlNYmhoRFhvcGNfc3RXSFJnN2swQ0FYRTExNHg3SXV6TjdTUzJXOWVhZ3piVklnbUpZY19yV3ZZMUd0Mnl5YjF0akV4WEJpZFNRV2E2OEVGVVA2NGhqZHUzeldZaE1lckdWMHBF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOaG9BTkM1Y1AxZG1vRHp0QUo0aEJYVk9jWXhfSFFHdnVjQ2RScUVOR215RWtLQnkzcGZSOFY5Q1U0eEg2bG96czR1T29UWDRfSXR6M3U3aDVoN05BRzZtazBmaHF6a1Fod29CMmNyNlFlUGNTZ1YtRWI1dzF4cjZkT2ZTbFVpbnd0NkNabjl4R2lSdlJ4RUZIZjNsQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFBpRjMycDJHV1VSdUl2cGVIbDVWQjVhWWRwdlhFS2w2WHVub3plX1ZQT0RCMG1mZDB4R2UzUzdoZ2NoQk5QVEcydDA5Q003c0luUmhBUzhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9SalhqY0RrQmh2Wnd1eGdxblktQThnLXdmYWw4OFp1U1diYmJaSDBjWURwOWY2RW5nSktFX09zM2Qxa2tHMHR2aWF2WGhHZ1JMN2JzYzRH